# --- Credentials: never commit ---
# Anything matching these stays local. Real values belong in backend/.env (already ignored above),
# never in a tracked file. If a credential ever does reach a commit, rotating it is the only fix —
# removing the file afterwards does not remove it from history.
keys.md
keys.txt
secrets.md
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key

# --- Editors ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
