._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Generated: synced copy of the shared fixtures ---
frontend/public/fixtures/

# --- Generated: evaluation output ---
# data/org/, data/ground_truth/ and data/synthetic/ ARE committed: a clean clone must reproduce
# the demo (PRD AC-15). Only derived reports are ignored.
data/generated/
